---
import { Phone, Mail, MapPin, Clock, ShieldCheck } from "lucide-astro";
---

<header class="pt-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem)] pb-8 bg-[var(--color-bg)] text-[var(--color-text)]">
    <div class="section-container">
        <!-- 1. Breadcrumbs de Navegación (sin eyebrow) -->
        <nav class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] mb-6 sm:mb-8" aria-label="Miga de pan">
            <a href="/" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--color-primary-dark)] hover:underline transition-colors">
                Inicio
            </a>
            <span class="opacity-40" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary-dark)]" aria-current="page">
                Contacto
            </span>
        </nav>

        <!-- 2. Titular Principal y Mensaje de Bienvenida -->
        <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto text-center max-sm:text-left mb-10 sm:mb-14">
            <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.35rem,4.2vw,3.45rem)] font-extrabold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.035em] text-[var(--color-primary-dark)] m-0 mb-4 [text-wrap:balance]">
                Contacto y Cita Previa
            </h1>
            <p class="text-[clamp(1.05rem,1.25vw,1.18rem)] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] m-0 max-w-[720px] mx-auto [text-wrap:pretty]">
                Sabemos que dar el primer paso genera dudas. Te ofrecemos un espacio de escucha atenta, cálido y confidencial para entender qué le ocurre a tu hijo y valorar juntos la mejor forma de acompañaros.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Bento de 3 Vías de Contacto Directo -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
            <!-- Teléfono Directo -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-[rgba(23,54,97,0.08)] rounded-[1.75rem] p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(23,54,97,0.03)] flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(23,54,97,0.07)] hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[rgba(36,79,158,0.08)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-4">
                        <Phone size={22} />
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-[0.78rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-soft)] block mb-1">
                        Atención telefónica
                    </span>
                    <a
                        href="tel:+34614992148"
                        class="text-[1.35rem] font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary-dark)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors block mb-2 no-underline"
                    >
                        614 99 21 48
                    </a>
                    <p class="text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] m-0">
                        Llámanos directamente o déjanos un mensaje para coordinar la primera valoración sin compromiso.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-[rgba(23,54,97,0.06)] flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.82rem] text-[#1e6e4a] font-medium">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#1e6e4a] shrink-0"></span>
                    <span>Respuesta en menos de 24h</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Email Directo -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-[rgba(23,54,97,0.08)] rounded-[1.75rem] p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(23,54,97,0.03)] flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(23,54,97,0.07)] hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[rgba(141,199,168,0.2)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#1e6e4a] mb-4">
                        <Mail size={22} />
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-[0.78rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-soft)] block mb-1">
                        Correo electrónico
                    </span>
                    <a
                        href="mailto:info@psicoinfantilcastellon.es"
                        class="text-[1.05rem] font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary-dark)] transition-colors block mb-2 underline underline-offset-2 break-all"
                    >
                        info@psicoinfantilcastellon.es
                    </a>
                    <p class="text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] m-0">
                        Escríbenos detallando vuestra inquietud y Ana Díaz valorará vuestra consulta de forma personalizada.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-[rgba(23,54,97,0.06)] flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.82rem] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] font-medium">
                    <ShieldCheck size={15} class="text-[var(--color-primary)] shrink-0" />
                    <span>Confidencialidad médica garantizada</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Consulta Presencial -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-[rgba(23,54,97,0.08)] rounded-[1.75rem] p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(23,54,97,0.03)] flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(23,54,97,0.07)] hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[rgba(223,162,170,0.25)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#8c3b47] mb-4">
                        <MapPin size={22} />
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-[0.78rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-soft)] block mb-1">
                        Consulta en Castellón
                    </span>
                    <strong class="text-[1.05rem] font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary-dark)] block mb-1">
                        C/ Río Támesis, 1, Esc. 1, 4ºA
                    </strong>
                    <span class="text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] block mb-2">
                        12005 Castellón de la Plana
                    </span>
                    <p class="text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] m-0">
                        Ubicación tranquila y accesible, pensada para la comodidad e intimidad de niños y familias.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-[rgba(23,54,97,0.06)] flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.82rem] text-[var(--color-text-soft)] font-medium">
                    <Clock size={15} class="text-[var(--color-primary)] shrink-0" />
                    <span>Lunes a Viernes · Con cita previa</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
